---
import TemplateLayout from '../layouts/TemplateLayout.astro';
import TemplatePills from '../components/TemplatePills.astro';
---
<TemplateLayout title="Dharmic Data | Great teachers. A future we share." description="A good teacher can change a life. A great teacher can change a civilization. Explore the school Jai Bhagat is building and start learning through Conscious Compute." bodyClass="dharmic-home school-home" active="home">
<section
          data-w-id="653b2948-49c4-c32e-b63a-70f84d615625"
          class="section home-hero"
        >
          <div class="container">
            <div
              data-w-id="3c50132f-2a0b-16e8-9125-859e5e677ab5"
              class="wrapper home-hero"
            >
              <div class="hero-contents home">
                <div data-w-id="6f30d9f5-f993-3688-8721-13a6b94a8ccb">
                  <p data-wf--subtitle-text--variant="base" class="subtitle">
                    A good teacher can change the course of someone's life.
                  </p>
                </div><div class="div-block">
                  <div
                    data-w-id="606f2837-0d5c-a39e-e1b3-943c0ca7dad4"
                    class="hero-flex"
                  >
                    <h1 id="hero-title" class="dharmic-primary-heading"><span class="hero-title">A great teacher</span>{" "}<span class="cta-title digital">can change the course</span>{" "}<span class="hero-title">of an entire</span>{" "}<span class="cta-title partner">civilization.</span></h1><img
                      src="/assets/cdn/69577d21-695b7bc89eeea7bb104368a2_Frame-40.svg"
                      loading="lazy"
                      alt="Hero Star"
                      class="hero-star"
                    /><img
                      src="/assets/cdn/69577d21-695b828603602d5c37661315_Vector.webp"
                      loading="lazy"
                      alt="Hero Icon"
                      class="hero-icon left"
                    /><img
                      src="/assets/cdn/69577d21-695b8284add3e48c66f22636_Star-1.webp"
                      loading="lazy"
                      alt="Hero Icon"
                      class="hero-icon right"
                    />
                  </div><p
                    data-w-id="a2d24a18-361b-0a07-2ec0-785044013ee6"
                    class="hero-para"
                  >
                    I'm Jai. I want to pay a generation to become builders, owners and stewards of their communities' AI future. Dharmic Data is the school I'm building to make that possible.
</p>
                </div><div data-w-id="6da00be6-c186-04e6-295a-e480e5576993">
                  <a
                    data-wf--primary-button--variant="black"
                    data-w-id="5e04e5d2-a7d2-705e-d362-7d1873101255"
                    href="/learn"
                    class="primary-button w-variant-e28ee448-7aef-9746-10fe-f6086371a8a4 w-inline-block"
                    ><div class="button-texts">
                      <div class="button-text _01">Learn with Jai</div><div
                        class="button-text _02"
                      >
                        Learn with Jai
                      </div>
                    </div></a
                  >
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div><div
            class="home-rive"
            data-rive-url="/assets/cdn/69577d21-6995b79cfaa7bf474085d59c_home_page_character_1-1-.riv"
            data-rive-state-machine="State Machine 1"
            data-rive-artboard="Artboard"
            data-rive-autoplay="true"
            data-rive-is-touch-scroll-enabled="true"
            data-rive-automatically-handle-events="true"
            data-rive-fit="cover"
            data-rive-alignment="center"
            data-animation-type="rive"
          >
            <canvas style="height:100%;width:100%"></canvas>
          </div>
        </section>
<section id="mission" class="section about template-mission">
  <div class="container"><div class="template-mission-inner">
    <p class="subtitle white">Dharmic Data / A school in the making</p>
    <h2>America can build extraordinary AI and still fail to build a future <span class="sticker green">its people have a stake in.</span></h2>
    <p>My bet is to pay people to learn with great teachers and build for their communities. Conscious Compute is how we begin.</p>
    <a class="primary-button about-light" href="/school">Imagine the school with us ↗</a>
  </div><div class="wrapper about template-pill-wrapper"><TemplatePills /></div></div>
</section>
<section id="story" class="template-founder template-wrap">
  <div><p class="subtitle">The person making this bet</p><h2>I won an NVIDIA hackathon <span class="sticker coral">with friends.</span></h2><p>We imagined a call from your future self. A small act of care, made possible by people who knew how to build it.</p><p>The Dell Pro Max with GB10 we won expanded the work I had already begun through teaching. Now I'm using that same practice to imagine a school with other people.</p><a class="about-text-link" href="/about">Meet Jai and explore the 60-second film ↗</a></div>
  <figure><img src="/dharmic-assets/jai-portrait-motion.jpg" alt="Jai Bhagat in his Dogged Pursuits conversation" width="2025" height="3600" loading="lazy"/><figcaption>Educator, engineer and the person at the whiteboard.</figcaption></figure>
</section>
<section id="projects" class="template-paths template-wrap">
  <p class="subtitle">Where would you like to begin?</p><div class="template-path-grid">
    <a href="/school" class="template-path green"><span>01 / The school</span><h2>Imagine what<br/>we could become.</h2><p>Meet Conscious Compute, the paid-learning idea and the teachers who could carry it forward.</p><strong>Explore the school ↗</strong></a>
    <a href="/learn" class="template-path yellow"><span>02 / Learn with Jai</span><h2>Bring a question.<br/>Make something.</h2><p>Join a Maven Lightning Lesson or get the free film field notes and try the worksheet.</p><strong>Find your next lesson ↗</strong></a>
    <a href="/vlog" class="template-path coral"><span>03 / Work in public</span><h2>See the work.<br/>Question the result.</h2><p>Inspect build stories and the choices behind them. Follow the people already learning with Jai.</p><strong>Explore the build stories ↗</strong></a>
  </div><a class="about-text-link" href="/learn#proof">Nine learner accounts and four published case studies ↗</a><br/><a class="about-text-link" href="https://shakti.dharmicdata.org">Try the Shakti demo ↗</a>
</section>
</TemplateLayout>
